        <span>
          <br/>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Amount includes $46,672,243 Non-Regulated Plant in Service.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-7" id="fn-7" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Page 200, Row 4, Column C</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span>
          <br/>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Amount includes $444,627 related to the Right of Use Assets recognized as part of the adoption of ASC 842 Leases; this amount is excluded from Pages 204-207. The remaining $14,971,361 relates to the Camp Ripley solar financing. The Company does not currently have any capital lease obligations.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-8" id="fn-8" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Page 200, Row 6, Column C</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span>
          <br/>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Amount includes $0 Non-Regulated Completed Construction not Classified.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-9" id="fn-9" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Page 200, Row 11, Column C</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span>
          <br/>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Amount includes $591,014 Non-Regulated Construction Work in Progress.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-10" id="fn-10" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Page 200, Row 14 &amp; 33, Column C</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span>
          <br/>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Amount includes $29,156,415 of Non-Regulated Accumulated Provision for Depreciation, Amortization &amp; Depletion and ($239,569) of Non-Regulated Retirement Work in Progress</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-11" id="fn-11" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Page 208, Row 15, Column B</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span>
          <br/>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Amount includes $46,672,243 Non-Regulated Plant in Service and $0 Non-Regulated Completed Construction Not Classified, and excludes $444,627 related to Right of Use Assets recognized as part of the adoption of ASC 842 - Leases. The Company does not currently have any capital lease obligations.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-12" id="fn-12" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Page 208, Row 15, Column C</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span>
          <br/>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Amount includes $29,156,415 Non-Regulated Accumulated Provision for Depreciation, Amortization &amp; Depletion and ($239,569) Non-Regulated Retirement Work in Progress.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-13" id="fn-13" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Page 232, Row 1, Column A</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:5pt;text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Net of Tax AFUDC in Plant.</span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">These assets are offsets to deferred income taxes recognized on certain regulatory temporary differences, which will reverse over the remaining lives of the related assets.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-14" id="fn-14" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Page 232, Row 2, Column A</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:5pt;text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Asset Retirement Obligation Deferrals.</span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">These assets will accrete and be amortized over the lives of the related property with asset retirement obligations.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-15" id="fn-15" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Page 232, Row 3 Column A</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:5pt;text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Acquisition Costs for Wind Projects.</span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">These assets are amortized over the life of the related property, plant and equipment.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-16" id="fn-16" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Page 232, Row 4, Column A</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:5pt;text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Medicare Part D.</span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">This regulatory asset is being amortized over 24 years as ordered in MPUC docket number GR-16-664.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-17" id="fn-17" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Page 232, Row 5, Column A</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:5pt;text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Accounting Standards Codification (ASC) 715 - Pension.</span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Defined benefit pension items included in Minnesota Power's regulated operations, which are otherwise required to be recognized in accumulated other comprehensive income, are recognized as regulatory assets or regulatory liabilities on the Consolidated Balance Sheet. The asset or liability will decrease as the deferred items are amortized and recognized as components of net periodic benefit cost.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-18" id="fn-18" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Page 232, Row 6, Column A</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:5pt;text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Accounting Standards Codification (ASC) 715 - Supplemental Executive Retirement Plan.</span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Defined benefit other postretirement items included in Minnesota Power's regulated operations, which are otherwise required to be recognized in accumulated other comprehensive income, are recognized as regulatory assets or regulatory liabilities on the Consolidated Balance Sheet. The asset or liability will decrease as the deferred items are amortized and recognized as components of net periodic benefit cost.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-19" id="fn-19" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Page 232, Row 7, Column A</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:5pt;text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Other Deferred Taxes.</span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">These assets are offsets to deferred income taxes recognized on certain regulatory temporary differences, which will reverse over the remaining lives of the related assets.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-20" id="fn-20" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Page 232, Row 8, Column A</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:5pt;text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Cost Recovery Tracker Riders.</span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">This regulatory asset represents revenue recognized from Minnesota Power customers in excess of the cash collected. Any balance is expected to be collected within two years. The cost recovery tracker riders included are: Transmission Tracker Rider, Renewable Tracker Rider, and Solar Tracker Rider.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-21" id="fn-21" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Page 232, Row 9, Column A</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:5pt;text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Deferred Rate Case Expense.</span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">This regulatory asset primarily represents the deferred rate case expenses related to MPUC Docket No. E015/GR-23-155, which are being amortized over three years.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-22" id="fn-22" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Page 232, Row 10, Column A</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:5pt;text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Fuel Adjustment Clause True-up.</span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">This regulatory asset represents the amount expected to be collected from customers for the under-collection of fuel adjustment clause recoveries.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-23" id="fn-23" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Page 232, Row 11, Column A</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:5pt;text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Pre-funded AFUDC.</span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Wholesale and Retail Contra AFUDC represents amortization to offset AFUDC Equity and Debt recorded during the construction period of Minnesota Power's cost recovery rider projects prior to placing the projects in service. The regulatory asset will increase during the construction of these projects, and then decrease over the remaining depreciable life of the related asset.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-24" id="fn-24" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Page 232, Row 12, Column A</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:5pt;text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Base Energy Adjustment True-up.</span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">This regulatory asset represents the amount expected to be collected from Minnesota Power's Northeastern Minnesota Municipal Power Agency customers for the under-collection of fuel recoveries related to base service.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-25" id="fn-25" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Page 232, Row 13, Column A</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:5pt;text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Taconite Harbor Energy Center.</span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">In the first quarter of 2023, Minnesota Power retired Taconite Harbor Units 1 and 2. The remaining net book value was reclassified from property, plant, and equipment to a regulatory asset on the Consolidated Balance Sheet when the units were retired. Minnesota Power is receiving recovery of the remaining net book value from customers as ordered in MPUC Docket No. E015/GR-21-335.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-26" id="fn-26" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Page 232, Row 15, Column A</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:5pt;text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Capacity Revenue &amp; Expense Adjustment True-Up.</span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">This regulatory asset represents the amount expected to be collected from customers for the under-collection of short-term capacity revenue and expense recoveries.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-27" id="fn-27" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Page 278, Row 4, Column A</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:5pt;text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">North Dakota Investment Tax Credits.</span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Credits expected to be realized from Bison that will be credited to Minnesota Power's retail customers through future renewable cost recovery rider filings as the tax credits are utilized.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-28" id="fn-28" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Page 278, Row 5, Column A</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:5pt;text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Pre-funded AFUDC.</span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Wholesale and Retail Contra AFUDC represents amortization to offset AFUDC Equity and Debt recorded during the construction period of Minnesota Power's cost recovery rider projects prior to placing the projects in service. The regulatory liability will decrease over the remaining depreciable life of the related asset.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-29" id="fn-29" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Page 278, Row 6, Column A</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:5pt;text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">SolarSense Program.</span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">This regulatory liability represents cash collections from Minnesota Power customers in excess of SolarSense Program expenditures. Any balance is expected to be returned to customers over two years.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-30" id="fn-30" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Page 278, Row 7, Column A</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:5pt;text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Accounting Standards Codification (ASC) 715.</span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Defined benefit pension and other postretirement items included in Minnesota Power's regulated operations, which are otherwise required to be recognized in accumulated other comprehensive income, are recognized as regulatory assets or regulatory liabilities on the Consolidated Balance Sheet. The asset or liability will decrease as the deferred items are amortized and recognized as components of net periodic benefit cost.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-31" id="fn-31" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Page 278, Row 8, Column A</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:5pt;text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Boswell Energy Center Units 1 and 2.</span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">In December 2018, Minnesota Power retired Boswell Units 1 and 2 and reclassified the remaining net book value from property, plant and equipment to a regulatory asset on the Consolidated Balance Sheet. The remaining net book value was included in Minnesota Powers rate base and Minnesota Power earned a return on the outstanding balance through the end of 2022 based on Minnesota Power's 2016 general retail rate case (MPUC Docket No. E015/GR-16-664). The regulatory asset fully amortized during 2021, switching to a regulatory liability that continued to accrete through the end of 2022.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-32" id="fn-32" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Page 278, Row 9, Column A</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:5pt;text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Non-Jurisdictional Land Sales.</span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">This regulatory liability represents the net proceeds from the sale of certain land by Minnesota Power that is expected to be refunded to ratepayers through a future rate case or through its renewable resources rider.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-33" id="fn-33" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Page 278, Row 10, Column A</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:5pt;text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Fuel Adjustment Clause True-up.</span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">This regulatory liability represents the amount expected to be refunded to customers for the over-collection of fuel adjustment clause recoveries.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-34" id="fn-34" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Page 278, Row 11, Column A</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:5pt;text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Base Energy Adjustment True-Up.</span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">This regulatory liability represents the amount expected to be refunded to Northeastern Minnesota Municipal Power Agency customers for the over-collection of fuel recoveries related to base service.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-35" id="fn-35" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Page 278, Row 12, Column A</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:5pt;text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Capacity Revenue &amp; Expense Adjustment True-Up.</span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">This regulatory liability represents the amount expected to be refunded to customers for the over-collection of short-term capacity revenue and expense recoveries.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-36" id="fn-36" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#333333;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Page 278, Line 13, Column A</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span>
          <br/>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#333333;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Clean Firm Technology Fund.</span>
        <span style="color:#333333;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">This regulatory liability represents ALLETE's merger commitment to establish a $50 million Clean Firm Technology Fund mandated in MPUC Docket No. E015/PA-24-198.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-37" id="fn-37" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#333333;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Page 278, Row 14, Column A</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span>
          <br/>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#333333;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Long-term Residential Energy Bill Mitigation Fund.</span>
        <span style="color:#333333;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">This regulatory liability represents ALLETE's merger commitment to establish a $10 million Long-term Residential Energy Bill Mitigation Fund mandated in MPUC Docket No. E015/PA-24-198.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-38" id="fn-38" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Page 278, Row 15, Column A</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span>
          <br/>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Transmission Formula Rates.</span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">This current regulatory liability represents an accrued liability for the MISO Attachment O, GG, ZZ true-up related to MISO rates billed and expected to be returned to customers in future periods.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-39" id="fn-39" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Page 278, Row 16, Column A</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:5pt;text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Energy Conservation and Optimization Program.</span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">This regulatory liability represents cash collections from Minnesota Power customers in excess of ECO expenditures and financial incentives earned for cost-effective program achievements. Any balance is expected to be returned to customers over the next year.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-40" id="fn-40" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:99.702%">
          <tr>
            <td style="width:1.0%"/>
            <td style="width:18.900%"/>
